            <div class="faqsectionbubble">
              <div class="questionwrapper">
                <div class="question"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                  Do you provide a same day service?
                </p></div>
                <div class="v"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                  v
                </p></div>
              </div>
              <hr>
              <div class="answerhidden"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                Yes, however this is subject to availability and prices will increase and vary depending on details. Prices on request, contact us to discuss.
                Occasionally, your booking may get collected and delivered on the same day at no increase in price if it can be done on the same run with the same driver. We will always contact you in these circumstances.

              </p></div>
              <div class="questionwrapper">
                <div class="question"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                  Do you deliver outside of the U.K?
                </p></div>
                <div class="v"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                  v
                </p></div>
              </div>
              <hr>
              <div class="answerhidden"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                No, we only deliver in mainland England*, Wales and certain areas of Scotland, and to Belfast Docks in Ireland only.

                *Arrangements can be made for Isle of Wight where birds can be delivered to the hovercraft port at Southsea. Contact before booking.

              </p></div>
               <div class="questionwrapper">
                <div class="question"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                  Do you deliver to Scotland and Ireland?
                </p></div>
                <div class="v"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                  v
                </p></div>
              </div>
              <hr>
              <div class="answerhidden"><p style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px;">
                We cover mainland Scotland weekly with some exceptions; 
                we only go as far as Aberdeen or Inverness every <b>4-5</b> weeks. 
                We do not cover certain PH postcodes. 
                <br><br>
                If you live in the affected areas there is an alternative option to <b>arrange to meet our drivers further down</b> in Scotland on our weekly delivery day, please contact us in advance to arrange this.
                <br><br>
                <b>For birds going to Ireland, please contact us to arrange. </b>
                <br><br>

              </p></div>
